card.statement:
Given $w\in\mathbb{Z}^{3}$, the tableau associated to $w$ with respect to $\mathcal{B}(T(\bar{v}))$ is defined by

\begin{equation*}\Tab(w):=\begin{cases}
T(\bar{v}+w), & \text{ if } w_{21}\leq w_{22}\\
\mathcal{D}T(\bar{v}+w), & \text{ if } w_{21}>w_{22}.
\end{cases}
\end{equation*}

In particular, $\mathcal{B}(T(\bar{v}))=\{\Tab(w)\ |\  w\in\mathbb{Z}^{3}\}$.
